DGIP-DATA LICENSING
===================

Copyright 2026 Daviante (https://daviante.org)

This repository distributes two categories of material under standard open licenses:

1. COMPILED DATASETS (*.csv.gz, *.mmdb, bundle.tar.gz, manifest.json)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
To the extent that Daviante holds any copyright, database right, or sui generis
extraction right in the compiled IP range, Autonomous System, and country-level
geolocation tables published in this repository's releases, Daviante dedicates
those compiled datasets to the public domain worldwide under the Open Data
Commons Public Domain Dedication and License (PDDL) v1.0:

    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/pddl/1-0/

Underlying allocation, routing, RPKI, geofeed, and threat-intelligence records
originate from third-party Regional Internet Registries, route collectors,
network operators, and open security projects. Daviante does NOT claim ownership
over third-party upstream data and does NOT transfer or sublicense any rights
belonging to upstream providers; see CREDITS.md, NOTICE, and docs/DATA_POLICY.md
for complete itemized ownership and attribution terms.


